--[[
    NEON LOCK | ULTIMATE UI EDITION  +  PLAYER LIST & ESP
    LocalScript: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts

    NOTHING IS BOUND WHEN IT FIRST OPENS.
    Click a bind button, press a key to bind it, or click the small "X"
    next to it to unbind it again.

    Bindable actions:
      Lock              Toggle target camera lock
      Random            Randomize selected target body part
      Speed             Toggle CFrame speed
      Flight            Toggle flight
      GUI key           Show / hide GUI

    Fixed flight controls (once flight is on):
      WASD              Flight movement relative to camera
      Space             Fly upward
      LeftControl       Fly downward

    NEW - Player list (side panel):
      - Click a player to SELECT them as your target (click again to
        deselect). Selecting does NOT lock the camera.
      - LOCK ONTO TARGET toggles the camera lock on the selected player.
      - Your Lock key locks the player nearest your cursor (falling back
        to the selected player if nobody is near it). Locking this way
        does NOT select anyone in the list - lock and selection are
        independent, so you can lock somebody else at any time.
      - Open / close the list with the LIST button in the header or the
        x on the panel.
      - Search box: filter the list by display name or @username.
      - DESELECT TARGET clears the selection (clicking the selected
        player again does the same).
      - The list updates live as players join / leave.

    NEW - ESP (side panel):
      TARGET ESP        ESP on the selected player (no lock needed)
      ESP ALL           ESP on every other player
      BOX               2D box + health bar
      GLOW              Highlight outline / fill (visible through walls)
      TRACER            Line from the bottom-centre of your screen to the
                        player's TORSO (always the torso, whatever body
                        part you are aiming at)
      NAME              Name above the box, distance + HP below it
      ESP COLOR         Cycle THEME / RED / WHITE / CYAN / YELLOW / ORANGE / PINK

    Use in your own Roblox Studio experience. Client-side CFrame movement
    may be overridden by server/network ownership rules in some experiences.
]]

